## Rubric
- [x] Verify begin_stream_part enforces 1..=10,000 part_number range (coordinator.rs:8088-8107)
- [x] Trace UploadPartCopy to create_upload_part_stream_session without range check (coordinator.rs:11948-11972)
- [x] Confirm create_upload_part_stream_session stores part_number without validation (coordinator.rs:8135-8164)
- [x] Check authorize_upload_part_copy performs no range validation beyond SSE-C scope (authz.rs:2793-2858)
